==Polish==

===Etymology===
Until the 17th century, it was used a feminine collective noun. From {{suffix|mąż|czyzna|tr1=man|lang=pl}} ''(collective suffix)'', from {{etyl|sla-pro|pl}} {{m|sla-pro|*mǫžь}} < {{etyl|sla-pro|pl}} {{m|sla-pro|*mon-g-}} < {{etyl|ine-pro|pl}} {{m|ine-pro|*man-}}.

